{"texte":"Switzerland hasn't fought a foreign war in over 200 years. Why? One: the Alps. Over half the country is mountains. Invading it is a nightmare. Two: in 1815, Europe's great powers officially recognized its neutrality. But neutral isn't weak: most men serve in the army, and keep their rifle at home. In World War II, they rigged their Alpine tunnels with explosives. Invade, and you win… nothing. And they're useful to everyone: banks, diplomacy, peace talks in Geneva. Attacking Switzerland costs too much. Leaving it alone pays more.","caracteres":["S","w","i","t","z","e","r","l","a","n","d"," ","h","a","s","n","'","t"," ","f","o","u","g","h","t"," ","a"," ","f","o","r","e","i","g","n"," ","w","a","r"," ","i","n"," ","o","v","e","r"," ","2","0","0"," ","y","e","a","r","s","."," ","W","h","y","?"," ","O","n","e",":"," ","t","h","e"," ","A","l","p","s","."," ","O","v","e","r"," ","h","a","l","f"," ","t","h","e"," ","c","o","u","n","t","r","y"," ","i","s"," ","m","o","u","n","t","a","i","n","s","."," ","I","n","v","a","d","i","n","g"," ","i","t"," ","i","s"," ","a"," ","n","i","g","h","t","m","a","r","e","."," ","T","w","o",":"," ","i","n"," ","1","8","1","5",","," ","E","u","r","o","p","e","'","s"," ","g","r","e","a","t"," ","p","o","w","e","r","s"," ","o","f","f","i","c","i","a","l","l","y"," ","r","e","c","o","g","n","i","z","e","d"," ","i","t","s"," ","n","e","u","t","r","a","l","i","t","y","."," ","B","u","t"," ","n","e","u","t","r","a","l"," ","i","s","n","'","t"," ","w","e","a","k",":"," ","m","o","s","t"," ","m","e","n"," ","s","e","r","v","e"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","a","r","m","y",","," ","a","n","d"," ","k","e","e","p"," ","t","h","e","i","r"," ","r","i","f","l","e"," ","a","t"," ","h","o","m","e","."," ","I","n"," ","W","o","r","l","d"," ","W","a","r"," ","I","I",","," ","t","h","e","y"," ","r","i","g","g","e","d"," ","t","h","e","i","r"," ","A","l","p","i","n","e"," ","t","u","n","n","e","l","s"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","e","x","p","l","o","s",